	(text "Raspberry Pi Pico (or Pico 2): same pinout, same firmware.\nFRAM MB85RC256V at address 0x50 (A0–A2 to ground), I²C at 1 MHz.\nMODE and SET buttons to ground, 1 kΩ + 100 nF against discharges and bounce."
